BOPAlgo: the builder of solids (BOPAlgo_BuilderSolid::PerformAreas) tests
each hole shell whose box meets a new solid's box for whether it lies in
that solid (IsInside), and mapped all edges of the solid for every such
hole: a solid of thousands of faces with tens of cavities, the union of a
machine's 257 bodies (mitcad#1279), mapped its tens of thousands of edges
tens of times. The solid's edges are now mapped once for all the holes
tried in it. The results are unchanged.
